  <data name="Disclaimer_P1" xml:space="preserve"><value>Beamcast exists only for study and case studies about screen capture, video codecs and real-time streaming on Windows. It is the research base for a separate, private, enterprise application. It is not a product and was not built for real use.</value></data>
  <data name="Disclaimer_P2" xml:space="preserve"><value>Any use of this app or this code for other purposes is the sole responsibility of whoever uses it. By using it you declare that you are aware of this and accept every risk, including exposing whatever is on your screen.</value></data>
  <data name="Disclaimer_P3" xml:space="preserve"><value>The author accepts no responsibility for the use, the results, losses or damages arising from this software. It is provided "as is", with no warranty, no support and no maintenance commitment.</value></data>
  <data name="Disclaimer_P4" xml:space="preserve"><value>Video traffic is not encrypted and the app has not been hardened for the internet. Use it only in study environments you control.</value></data>
  <data name="Disclaimer_P1_Text.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Beamcast exists only for study and case studies about screen capture, video codecs and real-time streaming on Windows. It is the research base for a separate, private, enterprise application. It is not a product and was not built for real use.</value></data>
